# 行尾统一：文本一律 LF，避免 Windows 工具写回 CRLF 后整篇笔记变成"全文改动"
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.canvas text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf

# 附件按二进制处理，禁止行尾转换与文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.bmp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
